# ============ Large generated artifacts (opt-in) ============
# The results/ tree holds ~100k stylized images. By default we keep the
# CSV/JSON metric tables under version control but ignore raw generated
# PNG/JPG to keep the repo light. Uncomment the next lines if you instead
# want to track everything (recommended via Git LFS for the images).
# results/**/*.png
# results/**/*.jpg
# results/cross_protocol/submission_pack/
